# MHMS Oral Screening - Environment Configuration Example
#
# IMPORTANT: This file is an EXAMPLE. Never commit real credentials.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in actual values.
#
# For GitHub Pages deployment, remember that frontend code is PUBLIC.
# Only put PUBLIC values in frontend configuration.
# Secrets go in Google Apps Script server-side configuration only.

# Backend URL (Google Apps Script Web App URL)
# This is PUBLIC - it's the deployed endpoint URL
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_SCRIPT_ID/exec

# Note: The following are configured server-side in Google Apps Script:
# - SPREADSHEET_ID (Google Sheet ID)
# - PHOTO_FOLDER_ID (Private Google Drive folder)
# - AUTHORIZED_USERS (email → role mapping)
# These should NEVER be in frontend code.
